listing:   capture of tcp_talk (tcp_talk.pcapng)
toolchain: TShark (Wireshark) 4.2.2 (Git v4.2.2 packaged as 4.2.2-1.1build3).
command:   tshark -r tcp_talk.pcapng -T fields -E header=y -e frame.number -e tcp.srcport -e tcp.dstport -e tcp.flags.str -e tcp.seq -e tcp.ack -e tcp.len -e tcp.seq_raw -e tcp.window_size_value
date:      2026-10-09T22:14:48Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
network:   private network namespace (unshare -n), loopback interface only
exit code: 0
